  "description": "Chae-I had always dreamed of marrying her first love. However, when her mother and her first love’s father remarried, she became part of his family; shortly after, he and her father disappeared, leaving behind nothing but a massive debt. Ten years later, after she had lived her life having long since forgotten her first love, two men with the same name as her first love appear before Chae-I. The love she thought had ended long ago resurfaces in the form of these two men, once again turning her life upside down.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
